  "cited_article_id": "post-payments-and-remittances",
  "reply": "To post an ERA: go to **Billing > Payment Processing**, open the **Unposted Remittances** tab, select the ERA or check batch, click **Match Invoices** (or manually enter amounts), review the balance, then click **Post & Close**. If payments were applied to the wrong invoice lines, go to **Billing > Ledger History**, find the transaction, click **Reverse Allocation**, and then reapply the funds using the posting steps above."
}
